00:14:08.320 --> 00:14:11.490
Chivalry? Honor and humanity?

00:14:12.370 --> 00:14:14.490
To hell with it all!

00:14:20.920 --> 00:14:23.710
Kuramochi! Kuramochi!

00:14:24.380 --> 00:14:25.630
Kuramochi...

00:14:35.260 --> 00:14:38.390
Enough is enough.

00:14:39.560 --> 00:14:43.980
Kuramochi didn't lift a finger against ya, did he?

00:14:43.980 --> 00:14:46.190
Am I wrong, bastards?!

00:15:05.500 --> 00:15:07.210
M-Mr. Kuramochi!

00:15:19.390 --> 00:15:20.230
Stop!

00:15:20.230 --> 00:15:21.980
Let me go!

00:15:28.940 --> 00:15:30.950
Move!

00:15:37.120 --> 00:15:38.580
Stop, Kaguya!

00:15:39.250 --> 00:15:41.210
I said let go!

00:15:41.210 --> 00:15:43.920
How laughable, Kaguya.

00:15:44.750 --> 00:15:46.960
Is that your idea of chivalry?

