00:16:20.040 --> 00:16:22.370
Um, Kaguya...

00:16:23.290 --> 00:16:28.210
I thought... Mr Kuramochi was saying not to... I...

00:16:28.210 --> 00:16:29.880
What do you outsiders know?!

00:16:32.630 --> 00:16:37.800
Do you know the feelings we protected that license with?

00:16:37.800 --> 00:16:39.010
Can you even know?

00:16:39.010 --> 00:16:40.430
I-I'm sorry...

00:16:40.430 --> 00:16:42.980
It's fine. Just get out.

00:16:48.060 --> 00:16:49.480
"Go become a Two"?

00:16:49.480 --> 00:16:51.780
Yeah, like the number.

00:16:51.780 --> 00:16:54.360
When I said I wanted to be a drifter Best,

00:16:54.360 --> 00:16:57.160
he said, "Before that, become a Two".

00:16:57.160 --> 00:16:59.950
Because you're still a One right now?

00:16:59.950 --> 00:17:04.410
Right! By the way, Dad is already about a Five...

00:17:05.290 --> 00:17:06.670
That's nice.

00:17:08.250 --> 00:17:10.750
Ai, you're sneaking food again?

00:17:10.750 --> 00:17:12.920
But I'm hungry!

00:17:15.380 --> 00:17:16.380
I'm home!

00:17:16.380 --> 00:17:18.300
Oh, welcome back.

00:17:18.300 --> 00:17:19.550
You were out pretty late.

00:17:19.550 --> 00:17:22.310
Yeah... you know...

00:17:22.310 --> 00:17:24.480
Wow, did you sell some paintings?

00:17:24.480 --> 00:17:28.310
Yeah. I bought your favorite, octopus, too. Shall I boil it?

00:17:28.310 --> 00:17:29.980
I want it as sashimi!

00:17:42.030 --> 00:17:44.040
Wh-What?!

00:17:46.370 --> 00:17:48.000
Mom, listen...

00:17:48.000 --> 00:17:50.210
W-Wait, th-the dog! The dog!

00:17:50.210 --> 00:17:52.590
I was lying when I said it was a school day.

00:17:53.090 --> 00:17:55.590
I joined a vigilante squad.

00:17:55.590 --> 00:17:57.590
The Mimasaka Peaches.

00:17:57.590 --> 00:18:00.850
That's no fair, Momo! I can't scold you like that!

00:18:04.350 --> 00:18:08.230
So that's why everyone came to me.

00:18:08.230 --> 00:18:10.480
Don't bother the adults too much.

00:18:10.480 --> 00:18:11.980
But Mom!

00:18:12.480 --> 00:18:14.440
I know you're working yourself too hard.

00:18:14.440 --> 00:18:16.030
You're taking years off your life.

00:18:16.030 --> 00:18:18.950
Don't worry. I'm not that weak.

00:18:18.950 --> 00:18:22.830
But I <i>do</i> worry! You're my only mom!

00:18:25.080 --> 00:18:28.040
There's no other country like this!

00:18:28.040 --> 00:18:32.290
Everyone just wants to live here normally.

00:18:32.290 --> 00:18:33.670
No.

00:18:34.460 --> 00:18:37.510
I won't allow you to fight that woman.

00:18:38.510 --> 00:18:40.010
Forget it!

00:18:42.760 --> 00:18:44.680
You don't have to go after her?

00:18:45.260 --> 00:18:48.180
She'll probably spend the night at the squad headquarters...

00:18:48.180 --> 00:18:50.060
She won't listen to me right now.

00:18:50.060 --> 00:18:54.070
Why won't you fight for Momo and everyone else?

00:18:54.070 --> 00:18:55.940
You're a Best, aren't you, ma'am?

00:18:56.900 --> 00:19:00.030
If you won't, I'll use that stone and—

00:19:00.570 --> 00:19:01.450
Huh?

00:19:03.030 --> 00:19:03.780
Uu!

00:19:03.780 --> 00:19:05.340
Chi?!

00:19:05.340 --> 00:19:08.160
Huh? What? Why? Why are you here?!

00:19:08.160 --> 00:19:09.710
Um...

00:19:16.710 --> 00:19:18.460
It just kind of happened?

00:19:18.460 --> 00:19:20.010
Huh?

00:19:20.010 --> 00:19:21.880
Who is that girl?

00:19:21.880 --> 00:19:25.010
Uh... Um, my friend.

00:19:25.010 --> 00:19:26.760
I'm Misono Chiaya.

00:19:26.760 --> 00:19:28.890
Thank you for taking care of Uu.

00:19:28.890 --> 00:19:29.850
Uu?

00:19:29.850 --> 00:19:32.350
Oh, that's my nickname...

00:19:32.350 --> 00:19:34.360
The octopus is gone!

00:19:34.360 --> 00:19:37.360
It must've been the dog or the ostrich.

00:19:42.200 --> 00:19:46.530
Even if a Rest tries her best,
she'll never get anything done!

00:19:49.330 --> 00:19:51.290
I think Ai's right...

00:19:52.370 --> 00:19:54.830
How could I take the place of Masami?

00:19:59.090 --> 00:20:03.090
If I were a Best, could I have helped her?

00:20:06.930 --> 00:20:09.600
I want to eat Mom's dango...

00:20:11.770 --> 00:20:14.100
I miss Dad...

00:20:17.400 --> 00:20:20.110
Are you still mad at Nonsuke?

00:20:20.110 --> 00:20:20.610
Huh?

00:20:21.030 --> 00:20:22.950
You're not mad anymore?

00:20:22.950 --> 00:20:25.070
Nozomi was the one who was mad.

00:20:25.070 --> 00:20:27.660
Nonsuke's not mad anymore.

00:20:27.660 --> 00:20:31.080
She looked really sad because you were gone, Uu.

00:20:33.160 --> 00:20:36.210
Even if you fight, you just have to make up.

00:20:38.340 --> 00:20:39.210
Haru!

00:20:41.210 --> 00:20:44.760
Haru! Momo went to the demon's castle by herself!

00:20:44.760 --> 00:20:46.470
The demon's castle?

00:20:50.180 --> 00:20:52.700
The stronghold of the Okayama Demons.

00:20:52.700 --> 00:20:57.610
The residence of the leader of the demons, Kukino Ura, and the squad members.

00:21:31.260 --> 00:21:35.230
I, Fujiwara Momo, am here as the representative of the Mimasaka Peaches.

00:21:35.230 --> 00:21:37.100
In accordance with the Twin Tower declaration,

00:21:37.100 --> 00:21:42.780
I request a one-on-one duel with the captain of the Okayama Demons, Kukino Ura!

00:21:43.820 --> 00:21:50.030
If I win, I'll have you lower the taxes that make everyone suffer!

00:21:50.030 --> 00:21:53.200
Come out, Kukino Ura!

00:22:06.260 --> 00:22:09.470
Staying up late isn't good for your skin.

00:22:09.880 --> 00:22:15.600
If you let your guard down because you're young, you'll regret it when you hit your thirties.

00:22:16.280 --> 00:22:19.190
Y-You're Kukino Ura?

00:22:22.270 --> 00:22:24.690
Fight me, demon woman!

00:22:30.700 --> 00:22:33.910
Anytime, anywhere is fine.

00:22:38.750 --> 00:22:41.210
Excuse me,

00:22:41.210 --> 00:22:44.130
is there a shop called Nayotake Bamboo around here?

00:22:44.130 --> 00:22:46.510
Oh, we're not from around here.

00:22:46.510 --> 00:22:48.880
Come on. Let's go!

00:22:49.470 --> 00:22:50.630
Hurry...

00:22:51.300 --> 00:22:53.180
Um, that shop is...

00:23:11.240 --> 00:23:16.410
Thou shalt not pass

00:23:16.700 --> 00:23:21.790
Laws, reason, nobody is getting past

00:23:22.120 --> 00:23:27.630
I don't care what you say

00:23:27.630 --> 00:23:33.090
I'm not letting friends and lovers in either

00:23:33.800 --> 00:23:37.220
My only companion

00:23:38.560 --> 00:23:42.980
is the faint moonlight

00:23:44.060 --> 00:23:54.910
I'm now sitting in the cockpit

00:23:55.160 --> 00:24:01.160
of the black shadow

00:24:01.160 --> 00:24:04.790
deep in the white moon

00:24:05.960 --> 00:24:11.840
Of the black shadow

00:24:12.220 --> 00:24:15.680
deep in the white moon

00:24:27.940 --> 00:24:30.940
You've probably already realized, but this show is a work of fiction.
Any resemblance to real people, groups, or laws is coincidental.
